    predicate: http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related
    rationale: The source expressly makes the two employment connections part of the industrial-accident
      question.
    evidence:
    - page: page/dmg-vol11-ch66/0059
      quote: "66301   Before accepting an accident as an IA the DM must be satisfied that it arose\n\n        1.\
        \      out of and\n\n        2.      in the course of\n\n        the injured person’s employed earner’s
        employment1 (see DMG 66061 et seq).\n                                                                  \
        \           1 SS Act 98, s 29(6)(b)"
